        "original_id": "c8c3a55a-90ff-5388-af8c-ed8d80e4a8b2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Paul Corbould, Chris Corbould, Neil Corbould\n- Films: Children of Men, Guardians of the Galaxy\n- Organizations: Marvel Studios, Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures\n- Topics: special effects, superhero films, Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Paul Corbould is a British special effects supervisor.\n- Paul Corbould is known for special effects work on the 2006 film Children of Men.\n- Paul Corbould is the brother of Academy Award-winning special effects supervisors Chris Corbould and Neil Corbould.\n- Guardians of the Galaxy, retroactively called Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 1, is a 2014 American superhero film based on the Marvel Comics team of the same name.\n- Paul Corbould is known for work on the 2014 film Guardians of the Galaxy.\n- Marvel Studios produced Guardians of the Galaxy, and Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures distributed it.",
